# Multivector Assault Mode counts combat damage dealt "to an opponent" only (CR 120.3, 310.6): when U.S.S. Prometheus, Prototype
# attacks Bot2's Liliana of the Veil instead of Bot2, the six damage is dealt to the planeswalker - no opponent is dealt any, so
# its 8+ ability does not trigger and Bot3 takes nothing, which is the state the game was in before the attack apart from the
# planeswalker's loyalty.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Kalakscion, Hunger Tyrant
Memnite
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
U.S.S. Prometheus, Prototype
Volcanic Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Island x3
Liliana of the Veil
Mox Jet
Swamp x2

[Bot3 Deck]
Volcanic Island x20

